import{_ as s,o as t,c as n,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 849 | Transcended Ones and Art | The Transcended One's Music and Consciousness Art","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 849 | Transcended Ones and Art | The Transcended One's Music and Consciousness Art","no":849,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Music","Consciousness Art","Consciousness Domain","Heart-Nature Purification"],"related":["806-Transcended Ones and Consciousness Overview","810-Consciousness-Domain Myriad-Rank Sharing Mechanism","26-Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle","846-Transcended-One Artistic Creation Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0849_模块4-超脱者与艺术-音乐与意识艺术.md","filePath":"en/0849_模块4-超脱者与艺术-音乐与意识艺术.md"}`),a={name:"en/0849_模块4-超脱者与艺术-音乐与意识艺术.md"};function o(r,e,c,l,u,d){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-849-transcended-ones-and-art-the-transcended-one-s-music-and-consciousness-art" tabindex="-1">Entry 849 | Transcended Ones and Art | The Transcended One&#39;s Music and Consciousness Art <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-849-transcended-ones-and-art-the-transcended-one-s-music-and-consciousness-art" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 849 | Transcended Ones and Art | The Transcended One&#39;s Music and Consciousness Art&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 26, 806, 810, 846</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-most-powerful-art-acts-directly-on-consciousness" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the most powerful art acts directly on consciousness <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-most-powerful-art-acts-directly-on-consciousness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the most powerful art acts directly on consciousness&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s civilization has a four-layer structure: material plane, energy layer, consciousness domain, law network. Ordinary art acts on matter and senses; <strong>consciousness art acts directly on the consciousness domain</strong> — it does not pass through ears and eyes, directly adjusting beings&#39; consciousness state. This is the transcended one&#39;s unique art dimension: he may use music and consciousness art to purify Myriad Ranks&#39; heart-nature, soothe energy disorder, and channel cultivation pressure. This entry explains how this &quot;direct-to-consciousness&quot; art is created, and what prevents it from becoming black art for manipulating hearts.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally embody <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong>: consciousness art directly acts on Myriad Ranks&#39; consciousness, therefore is the highest-risk art, supervised most strictly; <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> requires it serve all beings&#39; spiritual health; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires it not manipulate or brainwash; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires it nourish Myriad Ranks&#39; heart-nature for common uplift; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires consciousness art&#39;s mechanism be self-consistent, not written as a &quot;protagonist sings a song and controls all beings&quot; golden finger.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-what-is-consciousness-art" tabindex="-1">I. What Is Consciousness Art <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-what-is-consciousness-art" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. What Is Consciousness Art&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Consciousness art is an art form acting directly on the consciousness domain. It does not pass through senses, but through consciousness interfaces:</p><ul><li><strong>Consciousness music</strong>: acts directly on consciousness with specific frequencies and rhythms, calming, focusing, restoring energy balance;</li><li><strong>Consciousness painting</strong>: not painted on canvas, but in the consciousness domain; Myriad Ranks &quot;see&quot; it in meditation;</li><li><strong>Consciousness narrative</strong>: injects axioms and stories directly into consciousness, shaping heart-nature deeper than language.</li></ul><p>Document 810 points out the consciousness domain is Myriad Ranks&#39; shared — this means once consciousness art is emitted, all Myriad Ranks&#39; consciousness may be affected. The greater the power, the heavier the responsibility.</p><h2 id="ii-what-it-solves-public-healing-of-heart-nature-and-energy" tabindex="-1">II. What It Solves: Public Healing of Heart-Nature and Energy <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-what-it-solves-public-healing-of-heart-nature-and-energy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. What It Solves: Public Healing of Heart-Nature and Energy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Consciousness art in Heng Yuan Zhou has real public functions:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Function</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Heart-nature purification</td><td>Soothes cultivation pressure, dissolves beings&#39; origin attachment / short-cut inner-demon disturbance</td></tr><tr><td>Energy channeling</td><td>Aids repairing consciousness disorder after going off cultivation track (with medical system)</td></tr><tr><td>Focus guidance</td><td>Helps cultivators enter stable perception and deduction states</td></tr><tr><td>Emotional settling</td><td>Lets Myriad Ranks, in long evolution, have a place to settle fear and hope</td></tr></tbody></table><p>It is not &quot;entertainment,&quot; but <strong>civilization-grade mental-health infrastructure.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-the-highest-risk-art-the-strictest-constraints" tabindex="-1">III. The Highest-Risk Art, the Strictest Constraints <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-highest-risk-art-the-strictest-constraints" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Highest-Risk Art, the Strictest Constraints&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Precisely because consciousness art reaches hearts directly, it most easily slides toward manipulation — the strong use consciousness music to brainwash Myriad Ranks, use consciousness narrative to implant obedience. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s constraints are the hardest among all art categories:</p><ol><li><strong>Do not implant, do not command</strong>: consciousness art only &quot;adjusts state,&quot; absolutely does not implant specific commands or positions into Myriad Ranks&#39; consciousness. It calms people, does not decide for them.</li><li><strong>Exit-able, reject-able</strong>: Myriad Ranks may at any time cut off connection with consciousness art, not forced.</li><li><strong>Alaya traces</strong>: consciousness art&#39;s sender, content, and influence range throughout leave traces; once manipulation signs are found, immediately investigate.</li><li><strong>The transcended one himself under strictest scrutiny</strong>: the transcended one himself is the most powerful consciousness operator; he himself first accepts the strictest ethics review — preventing him from using consciousness art to deceive himself or others.</li></ol><p><strong>Power that may directly touch consciousness must follow rules more strictly than blades and spears.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-with-the-individual-collective-balance" tabindex="-1">IV. With the Individual-Collective Balance <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-with-the-individual-collective-balance" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. With the Individual-Collective Balance&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Consciousness art&#39;s internal tension is: it too easily dissolves &quot;individual consciousness&quot; into &quot;collective consciousness,&quot; making people lose themselves. Document 26&#39;s balance principle lands here:</p><ul><li>Consciousness art nourishes the collective, but does not flatten the individual — Myriad Ranks still retain their own judgment and emotions;</li><li>It provides &quot;settling,&quot; not &quot;replacing&quot; — after listening to music, people still make their own choices;</li><li>Diversity is protected: each clan may have its own consciousness-art tradition, no forced unification.</li></ul><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: transform the transcended one&#39;s deep understanding of the consciousness domain into public spiritual healing, making Myriad Ranks&#39; heart-nature steadier, evolution smoother</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: consciousness art does not manipulate or brainwash, sealing the highest-level predation of &quot;using consciousness power to enslave Myriad Ranks&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style strong ones may directly dominate beings&#39; consciousness, as they please; Heng Yuan Zhou cages consciousness art in the strictest ethics</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: consciousness art adapts different interfaces for five-lineage life forms, serving all beings</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: consciousness-art principle, interface standards, and ethics constraints all open network-wide</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-consciousness-art-s-weight-and-self-discipline" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Consciousness Art&#39;s Weight and Self-Discipline <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-consciousness-art-s-weight-and-self-discipline" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Consciousness Art&#39;s Weight and Self-Discipline&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Consciousness art directly acts on consciousness, therefore its supervision level is highest, most watched by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision. The transcended one creating consciousness art — whether his work only &quot;adjusts state&quot; and does not &quot;implant commands,&quot; whether voluntarily accepted by Myriad Ranks, whether truly healed heart-nature — all assessed and converted into civilizational weight. He himself is first this ethics&#39; strictest executor — because he is the one most able to use consciousness art for evil. When the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm cages the power that reaches hearts most directly in the strictest cage, Myriad Ranks for the first time own the freedom of &quot;nourished by beauty yet not ruled by beauty&quot; — this is precisely consciousness art&#39;s orthodox boundary in a symbiotic civilization.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Music and consciousness art is the transcended one&#39;s softest yet most dangerous art dimension. It may purify Myriad Ranks&#39; heart-nature, soothe civilization&#39;s anxiety, yet may also become black art for manipulating hearts. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is: <strong>one may use consciousness art to love people, but absolutely not to control people.</strong> When the power that reaches hearts most directly is constrained by the strictest ethics, Myriad Ranks for the first time own the freedom of &quot;nourished by beauty, yet not ruled by beauty.&quot; This is consciousness art&#39;s orthodox boundary in a symbiotic civilization.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/806_模块4-超脱者与意识-总论.html">Entry 806 · Transcended Ones and Consciousness Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/810_模块4-超脱者与意识-意识域万族共享机制.html">Entry 810 · Consciousness-Domain Myriad-Rank Sharing Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/26-个体与集体平衡原理.html">Entry 26 · Individual-and-Collective Balance Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/846_模块4-超脱者与艺术-总论.html">Entry 846 · Transcended-One Artistic Creation Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const g=s(a,[["render",o]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
